 Any of a number of chemical elements in the periodic table that form a metallic bond with other metal atoms; generally shiny, somewhat malleable and hard, often a conductor of heat and electricity.

 Any material with similar physical properties as those chemical elements, especially as a combination of several of them, such as an alloy.

 An element which was not directly created after the Big Bang but instead formed through nuclear reactions; any element other than hydrogen and helium.

 Crushed rock, stones etc. used to make a road.

 The ore from which a metal is derived.
 A mine from which ores are taken.', null, 'oxford_3000_5000', '2026-05-17 13:00:02.386709+00', '2026-05-24 18:33:47.455389+00'), ('ecae9a65-1411-4a75-a1ac-56e5badf7750', 'ウイスキー', 'ja', 'B1', 'Noun', '/uisukii/', 'whisky', null, 'jlpt_n3', '2026-05-17 12:43:41.107171+00', '2026-05-19 22:05:36.988686+00'), ('ecb035fd-7b80-4fea-8aba-10f4d41645d6', 'compliquer', 'fr', 'B2', 'verb', '/kõplikəʁ/', 'to complicate', null, 'fr_cefr_vocab', '2026-05-20 20:09:13.663233+00', '2026-05-29 18:12:26.911801+00'), ('ecb0776b-1f75-4f7f-a8a9-949d0dc2f98c', 'pessimiste', 'fr', 'B2', 'adj', '/pəsimistə/', null, null, 'fr_cefr_vocab', '2026-05-20 20:09:13.663233+00', '2026-05-20 20:09:13.663233+00'), ('ecb15ef9-e205-4c64-8a9b-6606a6862616', 'fresh', 'en', 'A2', 'adj', '/freʃ/', 'Newly produced or obtained; recent.', null, 'oxford_3000_5000', '2026-05-17 13:00:02.386709+00', '2026-06-14 15:38:51.123614+00'), ('ecb16c6c-001c-4726-b13a-755abfdfb98d', 'randonnée', 'fr', 'B2', 'noun', '/ʁɑ̃dõneə/', null, null, 'fr_cefr_vocab', '2026-05-20 20:09:13.663233+00', '2026-05-20 20:09:13.663233+00'), ('ecb16cfe-ae61-4bba-8651-341cfb1e0879', 'unhappy', 'en', 'A2', 'adj', '/ʌnˈhæpi/', 'Not happy; sad.', null, 'oxford_3000_5000', '2026-05-17 13:00:02.386709+00', '2026-06-11 15:32:01.648251+00'), ('ecb17360-3592-4caf-9ed9-dbfd26b6b975', '品種', 'ja', 'C1', 'Noun', '/hinshu/', 'brand, kind, description', null, 'jlpt_n1', '2026-05-17 12:43:43.041921+00', '2026-05-19 23:16:41.089229+00'), ('ecb38232-af9e-4295-a6ab-ec0e7f604406', '破れる', 'ja', 'B1', 'Verb', '/yabureru/', 'to be torn, to be worn out', null, 'jlpt_n3', '2026-05-17 12:43:41.107171+00', '2026-05-20 00:04:02.731219+00'), ('ecb57ccc-19cd-48b8-91b9-73d2d24dae12', 'bebo', 'es', 'B2', 'Noun', '/βeβo/', 'baby', null, 'es_cefr_vocab', '2026-05-20 19:56:05.641062+00', '2026-05-20 21:32:23.704432+00'), ('ecb675e6-b024-4ceb-bce1-3151eb0ec394', '그것을', 'ko', 'A2', null, '/kɯkʌtɯl/', null, null, 'ko_frequency', '2026-05-20 20:23:27.234493+00', '2026-05-20 22:04